WEBVTT

00:07.040 --> 00:08.920
‎SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:35.280 --> 01:38.920
ADAPTED FROM JIA JIN CHAI, ORIGINAL NOVEL
BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:42.000 --> 01:45.920
XIANZHUANG

01:46.000 --> 01:48.000
DEEP CLOUDS, TWILIGHT SEAS

01:51.880 --> 01:53.960
Lady Shou'an, she's here.

01:58.400 --> 02:02.280
Child, come closer.
Let me have a good look at you.

02:03.160 --> 02:04.200
Go on!

02:05.200 --> 02:06.560
Mind your manners!

02:08.160 --> 02:10.000
I told you again and again

02:10.080 --> 02:11.880
to bring her here nicely

02:11.960 --> 02:13.000
and do not frighten her!

02:17.120 --> 02:19.080
Lady Shou'an,
you had me seized at midnight.

02:20.120 --> 02:21.120
What do you want from me?

02:25.640 --> 02:27.240
What a lovely young woman.

02:28.000 --> 02:30.360
Beautiful and poised.

02:30.440 --> 02:33.160
You are even more like
my granddaughter than Rao.

02:34.280 --> 02:35.600
But, child,

02:35.680 --> 02:38.640
you're always on guard, always wary.

02:39.160 --> 02:41.560
It shows
how frightened and uneasy you are.

02:41.640 --> 02:45.440
Do you really want to spend
the rest of your life

02:45.520 --> 02:48.400
walking on eggshells like this?

02:48.480 --> 02:49.920
I asked you here today

02:50.000 --> 02:52.640
because I want to make you a deal.

02:55.360 --> 02:56.640
What kind of deal?

03:00.680 --> 03:02.680
You took a place that wasn't yours.

03:02.760 --> 03:04.560
How can you ever live in peace?

03:05.440 --> 03:07.600
If you're willing to step aside,

03:07.680 --> 03:10.080
the Zhou family will compensate you.

03:10.160 --> 03:11.360
Everyone knows

03:11.440 --> 03:14.760
my eldest daughter
married into the Huo family in Jiangnan.

03:14.840 --> 03:19.160
Although the Huo family
isn't as powerful as the Lu family,

03:19.240 --> 03:23.160
they still live in luxury
and possess a vast fortune.

03:23.240 --> 03:24.280
Huo Jue.

03:28.440 --> 03:29.360
Grandmother.

03:31.360 --> 03:33.680
The Huo family is open-minded.

03:33.760 --> 03:35.520
they don't ask about birth or rank.

03:35.600 --> 03:38.440
They only want a smart, capable woman

03:38.520 --> 03:40.400
who can handle great responsibility.

03:40.480 --> 03:42.440
From now on, she will follow you

03:42.520 --> 03:44.280
and do business across the country.

03:44.360 --> 03:47.440
The perfect woman is right here.
What do you think?

03:47.520 --> 03:49.600
I wouldn't dare go against your wishes.

03:49.680 --> 03:51.600
I shall abide entirely by
Grandmother's decision.

03:52.680 --> 03:54.240
You heard him.

03:54.320 --> 03:57.360
Once you become Huo Jue's wife,

03:57.440 --> 04:00.280
your enemies will become your family.

04:01.000 --> 04:05.040
You won't have to fear being silencedñ
or losing your life.

04:05.120 --> 04:08.000
As for the Lu family, I have my ways.

04:08.080 --> 04:11.000
Once you two secretly switch places,

04:11.520 --> 04:14.320
I'll keep Jundai out of sight.

04:14.880 --> 04:19.000
As time passes,
no one will question you anymore.

04:19.600 --> 04:22.200
Then this will all be behind us.

04:27.200 --> 04:28.400
What are you laughing at?

04:29.560 --> 04:32.360
Grandmother is even offering marriage
to put your mind at ease.

04:32.440 --> 04:34.360
Lu Zhuo may come from a powerful family,

04:34.440 --> 04:36.720
but the higher the stakes,
the colder his heart.

04:37.360 --> 04:38.760
If he ever learns the truth,

04:39.520 --> 04:40.920
he'll feel utterly humiliated.

04:41.520 --> 04:44.200
He'll be the first one to kill you.

04:45.720 --> 04:47.920
The Huo family trades far and wide.

04:48.000 --> 04:49.560
Keeping our word matters above all.

04:49.640 --> 04:52.840
I've personally agreed to this marriage.
I'll treat you well from now on.

04:53.600 --> 04:57.040
Come south with me and leave the capital.
No one there will know your past.

04:57.640 --> 04:59.960
You'll be free, wealthy, and safe.

05:00.760 --> 05:02.280
Better than living on the edge, isn't it?

05:06.680 --> 05:10.360
If you insist on being stubborn,
no one can save you.

05:12.520 --> 05:14.200
Thank you for your kindness, Lady Shou'an.

05:15.440 --> 05:16.720
How merciful of you to spare my life.

05:19.000 --> 05:22.080
As for marrying into the Huo family,
I'm not worthy of such an honor.

05:22.160 --> 05:24.040
You insolent servant!

05:24.120 --> 05:26.880
I'm the Huo family's eldest son.
You think I'm not good enough for you?

05:26.960 --> 05:29.120
Huo Jue, mind your manners.

05:30.920 --> 05:33.360
A lowborn woman may become a noble wife,

05:34.040 --> 05:36.280
then die of a sudden illness at home,

05:36.800 --> 05:38.960
or die giving birth,

05:40.080 --> 05:41.560
or accidentally drown,

05:42.080 --> 05:43.600
or fall from a horse and break her neck.

05:43.680 --> 05:46.800
There are many ways to make
a death look natural.

05:46.880 --> 05:48.320
Once I leave the capital,

05:48.400 --> 05:50.920
wouldn't my life be entirely
in my husband's hands?

05:51.640 --> 05:53.240
Who would seek justice
for a woman all alone?

05:54.400 --> 05:55.800
Lady Shou'an's offer

05:56.320 --> 05:58.800
only trades an immediate death
for a delayed one.

05:59.400 --> 06:00.920
One means dying now.

06:01.000 --> 06:02.560
The other means dying next fall.

06:02.640 --> 06:05.960
Threats didn't work,
so now you're tempting me with rewards.

06:07.160 --> 06:08.760
You even used your own grandson as bait.

06:09.600 --> 06:11.000
Lady Shou'an, you certainly bet big.

06:11.640 --> 06:14.520
You! You think too poorly of us!

06:14.600 --> 06:15.600
Who's trying to hurt you?

06:16.680 --> 06:20.080
Mother, I told you long ago.

06:20.600 --> 06:23.560
This woman is greedy, cunning,
and impossible to reason with.

06:24.080 --> 06:26.760
-Why waste your breath on her?
-Aunt.

06:27.360 --> 06:29.520
Mother, you're far too softhearted.

06:29.600 --> 06:32.080
Let me handle this.

06:44.680 --> 06:47.080
Who in the world would've imagined

06:47.160 --> 06:49.040
a lowly night-soil woman

06:49.560 --> 06:51.880
would dare impersonate my daughter?

06:52.400 --> 06:55.520
Such outrageous nerve!

06:56.040 --> 06:59.080
A-Chou, I'll give you one last chance.

06:59.840 --> 07:03.600
Kneel, beg forgiveness,
and repent for what you've done.

07:04.120 --> 07:05.640
Then I'll spare your life.

07:06.640 --> 07:08.000
Did you hear me?

07:08.080 --> 07:09.440
Kneel before Lady Li
and admit your wrongs!

07:10.320 --> 07:11.320
Wrongs?

07:12.800 --> 07:14.920
Your daughter was the one

07:15.000 --> 07:17.800
who made me take her place
and tried to kill me time and again.

07:18.760 --> 07:20.200
What did I do wrong?

07:22.080 --> 07:25.440
The high and low
have always had their proper place.

07:26.280 --> 07:28.640
You're nothing but a drab little sparrow,

07:29.320 --> 07:33.240
yet you keep trying
to force your way into a phoenix's nest.

07:33.760 --> 07:36.400
You've schemed and stopped at nothing.

07:37.560 --> 07:41.360
You are simply too greedy.

07:41.440 --> 07:45.000
Nothing could ever satisfy you.
That's why you've ended up here.

07:45.600 --> 07:48.240
Yet you still dare claim
you've done nothing wrong.

07:49.080 --> 07:51.160
If I say you're wrong, then you're wrong.

07:51.800 --> 07:53.280
Don't you dare talk back to me again!

07:56.400 --> 07:58.080
How ridiculous.

07:59.080 --> 08:01.560
Wasn't Lady Li a wet nurse's daughter too?

08:02.600 --> 08:03.440
Slap her!

08:05.360 --> 08:06.200
Aunt.

08:06.280 --> 08:07.760
Don't lower yourself by arguing
with an ill-mannered lowborn girl.

08:14.280 --> 08:17.000
I did nothing wrong.

08:17.600 --> 08:20.160
Child, why put yourself through this?

08:20.760 --> 08:22.200
Defying Lady Li is punishable by death!

08:22.880 --> 08:25.200
Do you truly want to die? Apologize now!

08:25.280 --> 08:27.000
What makes something right or wrong?

08:27.080 --> 08:29.400
The world isn't that simple.

08:30.040 --> 08:32.919
When it's cold and rainy,
you fear the silkworms will freeze.

08:33.000 --> 08:36.200
When the sun shines bright,
you fear the crops will dry out.

08:37.000 --> 08:39.960
Clouds harm the silkworms.

08:40.039 --> 08:42.360
Sunshine can hurt the crops even more.

08:43.240 --> 08:44.760
Even heaven
can't always please the farmers.

08:44.840 --> 08:46.480
I'm only human.

08:48.440 --> 08:50.360
I just want to survive.

08:51.160 --> 08:52.520
I just want to live with dignity.

08:53.720 --> 08:57.040
As long as I haven't broken the law
or killed anyone or set fires,

08:57.120 --> 08:59.080
I've done nothing
that weighs on my conscience!

08:59.160 --> 09:01.640
So what I've done,
what right do you have to call it wrong?

09:01.720 --> 09:03.920
Silence! I said silence! Do you hear me?

09:04.000 --> 09:05.000
No!

09:07.680 --> 09:10.600
Should I grovel before you
and beg forgiveness?

09:12.040 --> 09:13.600
Would you really spare my life then?

09:15.040 --> 09:18.320
Since you wouldn't,
why should I humiliate myself?

09:19.400 --> 09:20.360
In this life,

09:20.960 --> 09:23.880
I've knelt and begged more than enough.

09:32.240 --> 09:34.160
-You…
-Bring it in.

09:50.120 --> 09:51.200
You have two choices.

09:51.280 --> 09:54.160
Leave the capital with Huo Jue,

09:54.960 --> 09:56.920
and never return
for the rest of your life.

09:57.520 --> 10:00.400
Or I'll have you boiled alive.

10:00.920 --> 10:02.600
Then this ends with your death.

10:03.440 --> 10:05.440
I won't pursue your crime
of posing as a noblewoman,

10:06.200 --> 10:08.600
nor will I arrest or punish your family.

10:10.320 --> 10:11.560
You decide.

10:16.800 --> 10:18.680
EARL OF CHENG'AN'S RESIDENCE

10:18.760 --> 10:20.720
Mother, you're still
in the mood to tend flowers?

10:21.320 --> 10:23.400
The hibiscus you planted in the courtyard

10:23.480 --> 10:26.160
was completely ruined
by those women in Father's study.

10:27.080 --> 10:28.320
Really?

10:29.080 --> 10:30.280
Mother!

10:33.400 --> 10:35.280
Grandmother kept Father in line before,

10:35.360 --> 10:36.520
so he didn't dare behave so shamelessly.

10:37.480 --> 10:39.880
But since her eye trouble
left her confined indoors,

10:39.960 --> 10:41.280
he's become even more muddleheaded.

10:42.680 --> 10:45.760
Those flirtatious maids
in the courtyard were bad enough.

10:45.840 --> 10:49.280
Last month, he even brought in
two singers through the side gate.

10:49.360 --> 10:51.200
The whole household is in chaos.

10:53.840 --> 10:55.480
Children shouldn't speak ill
of their father.

10:56.000 --> 10:59.080
Your father's affairs
are no concern of yours.

11:00.080 --> 11:03.840
Look. Two flowers blooming on one branch.

11:03.920 --> 11:04.840
How lovely.

11:07.160 --> 11:08.120
There.

11:08.640 --> 11:10.400
I'll put it right here.

11:10.480 --> 11:13.720
Mother never seems to care
about anything concerning Father.

11:13.800 --> 11:15.680
I truly don't understand.

11:15.760 --> 11:19.040
But you seem so happy today, Mother.

11:19.120 --> 11:20.720
Is there some good news?

11:22.680 --> 11:24.040
The best news ever.

11:37.600 --> 11:38.920
Lu Zhuo.

11:39.000 --> 11:40.360
I was just coming to find you!

11:40.440 --> 11:41.720
Something happened. Wei Rao…

11:41.800 --> 11:42.640
I know.

11:43.800 --> 11:45.040
Wait for me.

11:57.440 --> 11:59.680
I thought you had more nerve than this.

11:59.760 --> 12:00.880
Turns out you're nothing special.

12:02.200 --> 12:05.800
I hear your real father
was a shameless gambler.

12:05.880 --> 12:07.440
Like father, like daughter.

12:07.520 --> 12:09.400
Dragons breed dragons,
phoenixes breed phoenixes.

12:09.480 --> 12:11.240
Eagles soar, while rats burrow.

12:12.360 --> 12:15.520
Fine clothes and precious jewels

12:15.600 --> 12:18.320
can't hide the greed in your blood.

12:21.200 --> 12:22.960
It's already dawn.

12:23.040 --> 12:24.880
What are you still stalling for?

12:24.960 --> 12:27.920
Admit your guilt and surrender.
I'll spare your life.

12:34.640 --> 12:36.400
My aunt always keeps her word.

12:36.480 --> 12:39.280
No one in this house dares defy her.
Bow your head and confess!

12:41.640 --> 12:43.240
Don't you value your life above all?

12:43.920 --> 12:45.520
Even if you only delay
your death till fall,

12:45.600 --> 12:46.800
at least you'll survive today.

12:46.880 --> 12:49.320
I only wanted to see

12:49.400 --> 12:52.280
how far a little sparrow like me
could go, how high I could fly.

12:52.360 --> 12:54.720
Too bad I'll never get the chance.

12:55.360 --> 12:56.680
I've done nothing wrong.

12:57.640 --> 12:59.960
Kill me however you please.

13:00.640 --> 13:02.960
What a stubborn girl.

13:03.480 --> 13:05.320
Even now, you still refuse to give up.

13:06.320 --> 13:09.800
Or do you really think I won't kill you?

13:14.320 --> 13:15.600
Then boil me alive.

13:17.040 --> 13:18.560
A-Chou!

13:25.080 --> 13:26.440
Lady Li, Lord Lu is here.

13:28.280 --> 13:29.720
Perfect timing.

13:30.560 --> 13:33.880
He came here himself.
That saves me a great deal of trouble.

13:34.480 --> 13:39.160
Let's see whether the Lu family
really dares oppose me openly.

13:39.760 --> 13:41.400
Make her see sense!

13:44.600 --> 13:47.280
What are you doing? Let me go! Let me go!

13:47.360 --> 13:49.160
What are you doing?

14:07.520 --> 14:08.600
Lu Zhuo greets Your Ladyship.

14:09.200 --> 14:11.000
You seem to be in quite a hurry, Lord Lu.

14:11.080 --> 14:12.360
Where are you rushing off to?

14:12.440 --> 14:15.520
I heard Your Ladyship
invited Wei Rao here for a visit.

14:15.600 --> 14:16.560
I shouldn't have disturbed you,

14:16.640 --> 14:19.320
but she's Grandmother's
favorite granddaughter-in-law.

14:20.200 --> 14:23.520
Grandmother kept asking after her,
so I came to take her home.

14:24.360 --> 14:26.400
I invited my own daughter here
for a reunion.

14:26.480 --> 14:27.640
What's the rush?

14:29.200 --> 14:32.360
You really are newlyweds,
so deeply devoted

14:32.440 --> 14:34.360
you can't bear
to be apart for even a moment.

14:35.520 --> 14:37.080
Rao, come here.

14:37.800 --> 14:39.440
Your husband is here to take you home.

15:13.920 --> 15:16.280
Your Ladyship,
what is the meaning of this?

15:20.920 --> 15:24.520
My late husband and I
were once deeply in love.

15:25.240 --> 15:27.880
We thought we'd grow old together.

15:28.600 --> 15:30.200
But fate had other plans.

15:30.880 --> 15:33.120
A great battle broke out
beyond Qiyang Pass.

15:33.200 --> 15:34.280
I lost my husband.

15:35.240 --> 15:37.600
Rao lost the father who loved her most.

15:38.280 --> 15:40.360
My husband died saving your father.

15:41.080 --> 15:43.440
So the old duke made a vow.

15:43.960 --> 15:45.960
One day, his heir would marry Rao

15:47.040 --> 15:49.480
to make up for her
losing her father so young

15:50.000 --> 15:52.440
and repay what the Lu family
owed the Wei family.

15:53.600 --> 15:56.880
We both know exactly
who's inside that room.

15:58.800 --> 15:59.880
Lu Zhuo.

16:00.600 --> 16:03.560
My husband and I
had only this one daughter.

16:04.280 --> 16:05.800
She was the treasure of our lives.

16:06.480 --> 16:09.960
And now,
I'm placing her in your hands myself.

16:10.040 --> 16:11.880
Treat her well.

16:11.960 --> 16:14.040
I used to be spoiled and willful.

16:14.640 --> 16:16.120
My foolishness caused many trouble.

16:17.040 --> 16:19.120
Mother gave me a stern lesson last night.

16:19.720 --> 16:21.120
I deeply regret what I've done.

16:22.680 --> 16:23.720
From now on,

16:24.320 --> 16:26.080
I'll control my temper

16:26.640 --> 16:28.560
and be a proper, virtuous principal wife.

16:29.280 --> 16:32.160
My Lord, you're generous and forgiving.

16:32.840 --> 16:35.960
Please let go of the past and forgive me.

16:43.440 --> 16:46.080
Even pure gold has flaws.
So does fine jade.

16:46.160 --> 16:47.640
No one is perfect.

16:48.240 --> 16:49.600
Rao grew up without proper guidance.

16:49.680 --> 16:51.920
So naturally, she became somewhat spoiled.

16:52.000 --> 16:54.080
From now on, I'll keep people by her side

16:54.160 --> 16:56.160
to guide and correct her at all times.

16:56.240 --> 16:58.560
She won't cause trouble again.

16:58.640 --> 17:00.760
She'll become a proper principal wife.

17:00.840 --> 17:04.599
The past is gone.
What matters is what comes next.

17:04.680 --> 17:06.680
Now take your wife home.

17:07.200 --> 17:08.880
Live in harmony from now on.

17:09.560 --> 17:11.520
You can still make a fine couple.

17:33.120 --> 17:34.320
My Lord.

17:35.160 --> 17:36.320
Lu Zhuo.

17:36.400 --> 17:39.000
I know you're a man of honor
who keeps his word.

17:39.600 --> 17:42.600
You would never break your promise
or cast aside what is right.

17:43.640 --> 17:44.840
Isn't that so?

17:44.920 --> 17:47.800
My Lu family kept the promise
and came for the bride.

17:49.520 --> 17:52.080
But did the Wei family keep yours?

17:53.240 --> 17:54.880
You broke faith first.

17:55.560 --> 17:57.240
You refused to board the wedding carriage.

17:57.320 --> 18:00.120
So don't dream
of another chance in this life!

18:02.160 --> 18:03.480
Lu Zhuo!

18:05.000 --> 18:06.600
I used to be awful,

18:07.600 --> 18:10.200
but only because my parents
weren't there to teach me.

18:10.280 --> 18:12.400
I never saw Father
from the time I could remember.

18:12.480 --> 18:14.400
Mother couldn't stay by my side either.

18:14.920 --> 18:16.080
Who was there to truly guide me?

18:16.680 --> 18:18.560
I wasn't born this cruel.

18:18.640 --> 18:21.360
You hate how vicious and overbearing
I am. I'll change.

18:21.440 --> 18:23.840
I swear I'll turn over
a new leaf from this day on.

18:23.920 --> 18:27.760
I'll never harm the innocent again.
I won't do anything you dislike again.

18:28.360 --> 18:31.560
Lu Zhuo, I'm not ordering you.

18:32.120 --> 18:35.640
Just take this as a mother's plea.

18:40.360 --> 18:41.200
Lu Zhuo!

18:42.920 --> 18:44.640
Mother, stop him!

18:44.720 --> 18:47.600
-Stop him!
-Lu Zhuo, how dare you!

18:50.160 --> 18:51.200
Stop!

18:53.920 --> 18:55.160
Move!

18:58.280 --> 18:59.520
Careful.

19:10.840 --> 19:13.120
Lord Lu! Lord Lu!

19:13.200 --> 19:14.560
You can't take this woman!

19:15.560 --> 19:16.560
She's an impostor.

19:16.640 --> 19:18.280
She's been deceiving everyone.

19:18.360 --> 19:19.560
Move.

19:20.080 --> 19:22.160
You've seen the real Wei Rao
with your own eyes.

19:22.240 --> 19:25.280
Your wife is standing
right in front of you,

19:25.360 --> 19:26.320
yet you refuse to even look at her.

19:26.920 --> 19:28.080
Instead, you're holding that woman.

19:28.680 --> 19:29.840
Have you lost your mind?

19:30.480 --> 19:32.640
When I was gravely ill and near death,

19:35.400 --> 19:38.520
she came here in the wedding carriage
for the lucky marriage.

19:39.400 --> 19:42.320
She married me
and joined me in honoring our ancestors.

19:43.160 --> 19:45.040
She is my lawful wife.

19:45.680 --> 19:48.760
As for anyone else,
they have nothing to do with me.

19:49.800 --> 19:51.400
You heard him, Mother.

19:51.480 --> 19:53.280
It's not that I refused to humble myself.

19:54.000 --> 19:55.800
That temptress
has completely bewitched him.

19:55.880 --> 19:57.800
He doesn't care for me at all.

19:57.880 --> 19:59.560
I'm the noble daughter of an earl's house,

19:59.640 --> 20:00.720
Lady Li's own daughter,

20:00.800 --> 20:03.160
yet I'm worth less to him
than a lowly night-soil woman!

20:03.680 --> 20:06.280
Mother, Lu Zhuo
has humiliated me like this,

20:07.080 --> 20:08.960
and you still won't stand up for me?

20:09.040 --> 20:11.040
I'll hang myself with a rope later!

20:11.120 --> 20:13.680
Better that than live in shame
for the rest of my life.

20:16.360 --> 20:17.280
Lu Zhuo.

20:17.920 --> 20:20.040
I tried to reason with you politely

20:20.800 --> 20:22.400
to preserve both families' dignity

20:23.360 --> 20:25.280
and protect your loyal family's good name.

20:25.800 --> 20:30.360
But if you truly anger me,
I'll take this before His Majesty.

20:30.440 --> 20:32.600
Can the Lu family bear the consequences?

20:33.200 --> 20:35.960
Lady Li, is that a threat?

20:36.560 --> 20:40.120
Call it a threat or a kind suggestion.

20:40.720 --> 20:43.400
I don't care how powerful the Lu family is

20:43.480 --> 20:45.720
or how many victories you've won, Lu Zhuo.

20:45.800 --> 20:48.120
If you dare humiliate my daughter,

20:48.640 --> 20:51.160
I'll make you pay a thousandfold.

20:52.040 --> 20:55.600
This woman is an impostor and a murderer.

20:55.680 --> 20:58.280
Without my permission,
no one can take her away!

20:59.160 --> 21:00.800
Quite the show of power, Lady Li.

21:01.400 --> 21:04.320
The Lu family's title
was earned through real victories.

21:04.840 --> 21:07.560
Every honor we gained
was paid for in blood.

21:08.400 --> 21:10.360
We won't be ruled
by a woman of the inner court.

21:11.560 --> 21:12.760
Zhao Song.

21:18.920 --> 21:22.000
My wife, Lady Wei,
freed tenant farmers and aided refugees.

21:22.080 --> 21:24.360
She helps the poor and those in need.

21:24.880 --> 21:26.720
Everyone in the capital praises her.

21:26.800 --> 21:28.320
A petition from the people
was presented to His Majesty.

21:28.400 --> 21:29.960
His Majesty was greatly pleased.

21:31.600 --> 21:35.200
He issued a special decree
granting her the title of Noble Lady.

21:36.440 --> 21:37.280
Her title is

21:38.600 --> 21:39.720
Wu'an.

21:41.400 --> 21:44.280
A Noble Lady?
His Majesty made her a Noble Lady?

21:45.080 --> 21:47.680
Impossible! A woman of such low birth

21:48.240 --> 21:50.480
can't hold the same rank
as a prince's daughter!

21:50.560 --> 21:52.000
Lu Zhuo, you deserve death!

21:53.520 --> 21:54.400
For her,

21:55.040 --> 21:56.960
you actually petitioned
His Majesty for a title?

21:57.720 --> 21:58.720
Now,

21:59.680 --> 22:01.080
I'm here to take my wife,

22:04.280 --> 22:06.440
Noble Lady Wu'an, home.

22:09.640 --> 22:11.240
Who still dares stop me?

22:13.360 --> 22:14.560
Zhao Song, ready the horses!

22:16.720 --> 22:18.680
-You!
-Make way!

22:19.440 --> 22:21.640
No! She can't leave!

22:21.720 --> 22:23.600
Mother, you promised to stand up for me!

22:23.680 --> 22:26.640
Kill her for me!
Then Lu Zhuo must die too!

22:26.720 --> 22:29.000
-Mother! Mother!
-Look at yourself!

22:29.080 --> 22:30.080
Take her away!

22:30.160 --> 22:33.040
Mother! Mother!

22:33.120 --> 22:34.880
Mother!

22:35.400 --> 22:36.840
Wretch!

22:45.240 --> 22:47.120
-Were you burned?
-Grandmother.

22:47.200 --> 22:49.080
I thought we could use
Aunt's authority today

22:49.720 --> 22:51.120
to force Lu Zhuo to take Jundai instead.

22:51.200 --> 22:52.520
But he actually secured
a title for that woman.

22:53.200 --> 22:54.800
What do we do now?

23:07.880 --> 23:08.840
Are you all right?

23:16.680 --> 23:19.080
XIANZHUANG

23:25.360 --> 23:28.200
Easy. I won't let you fall.

23:29.480 --> 23:30.680
Thank you.

23:33.480 --> 23:34.520
You worthless fool!

23:34.600 --> 23:37.320
After all I've done fighting for you,
you tossed me aside now!

23:37.400 --> 23:38.760
Any conscience at all?

23:44.360 --> 23:45.760
Her Ladyship is back.

23:47.400 --> 23:48.400
My Lord.

23:51.720 --> 23:53.200
I have something to tell you.

23:53.880 --> 23:57.040
If you didn't say it before,
then don't say it now.

23:58.480 --> 23:59.320
Go back and tend to your wound.

24:19.400 --> 24:21.640
It's fine. Don't worry.

24:22.160 --> 24:25.000
After soaking it in cold water,
some medicine will take care of it.

24:25.840 --> 24:27.680
How did you get hurt this badly?

24:32.240 --> 24:33.160
You…

24:33.240 --> 24:34.760
DEEP CLOUDS, TWILIGHT SEAS

24:34.840 --> 24:35.680
Wait.

24:37.240 --> 24:38.400
I'll do it myself.

24:50.560 --> 24:51.800
Were you burned?

24:55.240 --> 24:58.040
Getting out safely
always comes at a price.

24:58.640 --> 25:00.760
That must hurt so much…

25:02.320 --> 25:03.680
It's nothing.

25:03.760 --> 25:06.400
Back when I worked for a living,
I suffered far worse injuries.

25:06.480 --> 25:07.480
This is nothing.

25:08.480 --> 25:09.840
It doesn't hurt at all.

25:14.680 --> 25:16.680
It has to hurt. Don't pretend it doesn't.

25:16.760 --> 25:18.640
Look at you…

25:22.320 --> 25:24.640
-Fool.
-Let me see.

25:24.720 --> 25:26.120
I'm really fine.

25:29.120 --> 25:30.840
Get out of here!

25:44.800 --> 25:47.240
-Master, spare me…
-Why are you crying?

25:48.360 --> 25:50.040
Stop those tears!

25:50.120 --> 25:52.360
Make a sound,

25:52.440 --> 25:54.760
and I'll beat you to death.

26:02.080 --> 26:04.360
You worthless trash.

26:05.400 --> 26:06.760
How dare you insult me?

26:07.400 --> 26:09.440
Sooner or later, I'll tear you to pieces!

26:11.960 --> 26:12.720
Rao.

26:16.560 --> 26:17.960
Clean this up.

26:31.040 --> 26:31.880
Mother.

26:35.800 --> 26:36.880
Leave us.

26:47.280 --> 26:48.120
Remember this.

26:48.200 --> 26:51.240
No matter what happens,
never let your emotions show.

26:52.000 --> 26:55.160
If servants see you lose your temper,
they'll see right through you.

26:55.760 --> 26:57.800
Who would truly fear a master

26:57.880 --> 26:59.760
who's fierce outside but weak within?

26:59.840 --> 27:02.040
Especially those
who serve you day and night.

27:02.120 --> 27:04.200
You must treat them
even better from now on.

27:04.720 --> 27:06.400
Cruelty will only bring trouble later.

27:08.520 --> 27:09.360
Mother.

27:10.400 --> 27:13.000
You know how badly I've been wronged.

27:13.880 --> 27:16.520
I lost my temper. I know I was wrong.

27:18.120 --> 27:21.720
Now Grandmother despises me,
and the Lu family has cast me aside.

27:22.240 --> 27:23.520
If Father were still alive,

27:24.560 --> 27:26.760
someone would storm
the Lu Residence for me

27:26.840 --> 27:28.400
and demand justice.

27:28.480 --> 27:30.800
But now I have no one to rely on.

27:32.280 --> 27:33.640
Except you, Mother,

27:35.200 --> 27:37.720
there's no one else
in this world I can turn to…

27:42.120 --> 27:43.280
Don't be afraid.

27:46.680 --> 27:48.920
I'll always stand behind you.

27:51.160 --> 27:52.000
Don't worry.

28:04.840 --> 28:07.360
What about your legs?
Were your legs burned worse?

28:07.440 --> 28:08.280
Lift your robe. Let me see.

28:08.360 --> 28:10.760
I'm your own grandmother.
There's nothing to be shy about.

28:10.840 --> 28:13.840
They're really just burns.
They only look frightening.

28:14.560 --> 28:15.680
You…

28:16.800 --> 28:19.200
Mother. It's all that girl's fault.

28:19.280 --> 28:21.000
She's far too vicious.

28:23.120 --> 28:24.240
Sit.

28:26.000 --> 28:27.040
Sit down.

28:27.560 --> 28:29.960
We're family. No need for formalities.

28:31.840 --> 28:34.680
We agreed before
that we'd only frighten her

28:34.760 --> 28:37.680
and make her leave the capital
with Huo Jue without a fuss.

28:37.760 --> 28:40.920
As long as she never came back,
and we appeased the Lu family,

28:41.000 --> 28:43.120
the matter would've ended peacefully.

28:43.200 --> 28:46.880
Why make things more complicated
and let them spiral out of control?

28:59.840 --> 29:02.080
You… You lied to me?

29:02.880 --> 29:03.880
Don't tell me

29:05.960 --> 29:09.320
you really planned
to lure that girl out of the capital

29:09.400 --> 29:13.240
and secretly get rid of her?

29:13.800 --> 29:14.720
Mother.

29:15.680 --> 29:18.120
I've never killed the innocent.

29:18.200 --> 29:19.280
That woman called A-Chou

29:20.120 --> 29:22.280
is a condemned prisoner.

29:22.360 --> 29:24.200
She's a murderer.

29:24.880 --> 29:27.240
I'm only sending her where she belongs.

29:27.320 --> 29:28.400
What's wrong with that?

29:32.360 --> 29:33.400
Grandmother.

29:37.160 --> 29:40.440
Zhou… Zhou Fu. You've changed.

29:42.840 --> 29:45.840
You're still injured. Go get some rest.

29:55.280 --> 29:59.920
DEEP CLOUDS, TWILIGHT SEAS

30:03.480 --> 30:05.080
Fu…

30:05.720 --> 30:09.040
You were once so proud and honorable.

30:10.120 --> 30:12.760
Cold on the outside, soft at heart.

30:12.840 --> 30:16.560
You couldn't even bear
to harm a blade of grass.

30:17.080 --> 30:18.680
But ever since you entered the palace,

30:19.560 --> 30:22.320
your face isn't the only thing
that's grown cold. Your heart has too.

30:23.040 --> 30:24.920
That's a human life.

30:25.000 --> 30:27.840
How could you…just have her killed?

30:36.880 --> 30:38.720
Mother, think about it.

30:39.240 --> 30:41.480
Think about where I went.

30:42.280 --> 30:43.840
I had to fight to survive.

30:45.720 --> 30:47.760
All the hardships I faced…

30:50.720 --> 30:53.120
The palace is strict,
with eyes everywhere.

30:54.040 --> 30:58.080
I used your illness as an excuse
just to spend a few days with you.

30:58.760 --> 31:01.000
You should understand
how hard things are for me.

31:03.800 --> 31:05.680
As for that woman called A-Chou,

31:06.360 --> 31:10.240
she may mean no harm,
but that doesn't mean she won't hurt us.

31:10.760 --> 31:12.920
As long as she's living as Wei Rao,

31:13.000 --> 31:15.800
she and Rao can never coexist.

31:17.160 --> 31:18.920
Would you really sacrifice
your own granddaughter

31:19.600 --> 31:21.920
for an outsider?

31:32.600 --> 31:35.960
Didn't you notice that girl

31:36.480 --> 31:38.360
reminds me of someone?

31:39.000 --> 31:39.840
What are you saying?

31:42.320 --> 31:46.680
Back then,
someone knelt right here in this hall,

31:47.440 --> 31:49.000
just as defiant,

31:50.240 --> 31:52.160
questioning me again and again.

31:52.240 --> 31:53.760
I still remember it

31:53.840 --> 31:56.920
as clearly as if it happened yesterday.

31:57.640 --> 32:00.400
How could you have forgotten?

32:01.840 --> 32:04.000
I'm not saying you can't remarry.

32:04.080 --> 32:06.440
The capital is full of talented men.

32:06.520 --> 32:10.040
You can choose any of them,

32:10.120 --> 32:11.480
and I'll give you my blessing.

32:11.560 --> 32:14.160
But you mustn't marry
into that gilded cage.

32:14.240 --> 32:15.720
Have you lost your senses?

32:15.800 --> 32:16.760
I want to be Empress!

32:17.880 --> 32:18.720
What did you say?

32:19.320 --> 32:22.360
They used to call
me a wet nurse's daughter,

32:22.440 --> 32:24.600
too lowborn to be Empress.

32:25.200 --> 32:28.440
Now they call me an unfaithful widow,

32:28.520 --> 32:30.480
too immoral to be Empress.

32:31.160 --> 32:32.840
My husband died,

32:32.920 --> 32:35.960
and they openly and secretly
bullied me and my fatherless child.

32:36.040 --> 32:38.360
They wanted me broken, crying every day.

32:39.480 --> 32:40.640
They can dream!

32:41.680 --> 32:43.280
The more they say I don't deserve it,

32:43.360 --> 32:44.640
the more I'm going to be Empress.

32:44.720 --> 32:47.720
Just watch, Mother.
I'm going into the palace

32:47.800 --> 32:50.840
to carve out a place in this world
for myself and my daughter!

32:54.960 --> 32:56.080
Zhou Fu!

33:03.880 --> 33:05.440
Mother, are you confused?

33:06.040 --> 33:08.080
How can you compare me to a murderer?

33:08.160 --> 33:10.920
That's not what I meant. I just… I…

33:17.320 --> 33:18.280
Impossible.

33:19.120 --> 33:19.960
It can't be.

33:21.760 --> 33:23.680
Then just say I've lost my senses.

33:26.760 --> 33:28.560
Mother, don't be too softhearted.

33:29.280 --> 33:31.160
I brought her here today

33:31.680 --> 33:33.480
and you used
your authority to pressure her.

33:34.080 --> 33:36.760
But she wasn't the only one
I wanted to test.

33:37.400 --> 33:40.840
I also wanted
to test Lu Zhuo's intentions.

33:41.680 --> 33:43.560
If he'd agreed to my request,

33:43.640 --> 33:47.280
forgiven Rao, and taken her home at once,

33:47.360 --> 33:49.160
there'd still be room to fix this.

33:50.320 --> 33:51.680
But instead,

33:52.280 --> 33:53.960
his heart was hard as iron.

33:54.880 --> 33:56.760
So A-Chou absolutely

33:58.120 --> 33:59.720
cannot be allowed to live.

34:44.360 --> 34:45.960
My Lord, you saved my life.

34:46.840 --> 34:48.600
I don't know how I can ever repay you.

35:07.520 --> 35:09.400
Did you really need me to save you?

35:11.640 --> 35:13.160
Why would you say that, My Lord?

35:13.240 --> 35:15.080
I was trapped with no way out.

35:15.840 --> 35:18.000
If you hadn't arrived in time,

35:19.080 --> 35:22.720
I'd have been boiled alive
and reduced to a pile of flesh.

35:23.320 --> 35:25.160
You've shown me such great kindness.

35:26.680 --> 35:28.280
I'm deeply grateful.

35:29.560 --> 35:32.760
Even a lifetime of devotion
could never repay you.

35:37.880 --> 35:39.040
Liar.

35:41.000 --> 35:42.840
His Majesty always rewards merit fairly.

35:44.040 --> 35:46.560
Worthy men from the countryside
can receive fine appointments.

35:47.560 --> 35:49.920
You tore up those contracts
on the city tower,

35:50.000 --> 35:51.440
then won the people's hearts
by helping those in need.

35:52.320 --> 35:53.840
Everyone praises
your kindness and generosity.

35:53.920 --> 35:55.160
His Majesty

35:56.480 --> 35:57.840
would never leave such merit unrewarded.

35:59.480 --> 36:00.680
But that wasn't enough for you.

36:00.760 --> 36:03.920
You even brought Qi Zhongkai
and Han Liao as witnesses.

36:05.400 --> 36:06.520
What do you mean?

36:08.720 --> 36:10.120
You know exactly what I mean.

36:11.880 --> 36:13.280
Qi Zhongkai is obvious enough.

36:14.520 --> 36:16.280
He loses his head whenever he sees you.

36:17.880 --> 36:20.520
Everyone knows the Empress Dowager
despises Lady Li.

36:20.600 --> 36:22.000
They've been enemies for years.

36:22.600 --> 36:25.600
And Han Liao is kin
to the Empress Dowager.

36:25.680 --> 36:26.840
He's been watching you closely.

36:28.400 --> 36:30.080
If you'd truly died at Xianzhuang,

36:30.600 --> 36:32.960
the Empress Dowager
could've used it against Lady Li.

36:33.040 --> 36:34.320
The entire Zhou family

36:35.280 --> 36:36.440
would've been dragged into it.

36:38.000 --> 36:39.960
Unless Lady Li is truly a fool,

36:40.680 --> 36:42.320
she'd never kill anyone at Xianzhuang.

36:43.320 --> 36:44.720
She was only trying to scare you.

36:47.840 --> 36:50.440
I truly pitied those refugees.

36:53.200 --> 36:56.000
But you, My Lord, suspect everything.

36:58.200 --> 37:00.480
So why did you still seek
an imperial decree?

37:03.320 --> 37:07.840
Why not let them take me,
sell me off somewhere far away,

37:08.600 --> 37:10.880
so I'd never trouble you again?

37:11.960 --> 37:14.240
Wouldn't you have peace forever?

37:17.480 --> 37:19.040
I wasn't trying to help you.

37:20.280 --> 37:21.360
I just

37:23.560 --> 37:25.440
didn't want that vicious woman
into my house.

37:28.160 --> 37:29.760
Since you've taken her place,

37:30.720 --> 37:32.160
then hold on to it.

37:32.960 --> 37:34.360
If you dare give up halfway,

37:35.080 --> 37:36.360
I'll be the first to make you pay.

37:40.760 --> 37:42.040
No matter what,

37:44.200 --> 37:45.720
you saved me, My Lord.

37:46.680 --> 37:47.720
That makes you my benefactor.

37:49.080 --> 37:51.080
Whatever reward you want,

37:51.840 --> 37:54.040
I won't refuse you anything.

38:04.040 --> 38:06.680
In the name of repayment,
you seek to mend old ties with me.

38:08.360 --> 38:09.400
And if you're lucky,

38:10.800 --> 38:12.800
you'd bear my child and secure your life.

38:14.480 --> 38:16.120
Well, well, Wei Rao.

38:19.760 --> 38:21.600
Am I part of your next move too?

38:33.040 --> 38:34.160
Then you underestimate me.

38:36.480 --> 38:38.400
I don't want false affection.

38:52.760 --> 38:54.040
Forgive me for disturbing you.

38:55.520 --> 38:57.360
I've never met a woman like you.

38:58.120 --> 39:01.040
I can never tell when you're sincere
and when you're pretending.

39:02.040 --> 39:03.720
I can never read your heart.

39:04.840 --> 39:06.000
Let me remind you.

39:09.520 --> 39:12.240
Sweet talk and false affection

39:13.280 --> 39:15.200
will never win you a sincere heart.

39:16.320 --> 39:19.560
Only those who live in comfort
and without fear can afford sincerity.

39:20.840 --> 39:23.200
All I learned growing up
was how to beg and survive.

39:24.200 --> 39:25.920
If you want my body,

39:26.000 --> 39:28.200
or a smile meant to please you,
I can give you both.

39:28.800 --> 39:31.520
But don't ask me
for something I can't give.

39:32.880 --> 39:34.320
A sincere heart is too precious.

39:35.800 --> 39:37.160
I don't have one to give.

40:02.480 --> 40:03.720
What are you doing?

40:08.480 --> 40:11.840
His Lordship ordered us
to redeem all the jewelry you pawned.

40:11.920 --> 40:14.000
He also said that now you're a Noble Lady,

40:14.080 --> 40:16.240
you shouldn't dress too plainly.

40:16.320 --> 40:19.360
He had the storeroom opened
so you can choose what you like tomorrow.

40:28.400 --> 40:31.560
Lu Zhuo. Why are you so good to me?

40:43.400 --> 40:45.920
Bitao, you're
Noble Lady Wu'an's favorite now.

40:46.520 --> 40:49.480
I suppose you've forgotten
how Madam once helped you.

40:50.200 --> 40:52.640
Her Ladyship will suspect something
if she wakes and I'm gone.

40:52.720 --> 40:54.600
I don't have time for your nonsense.

40:54.680 --> 40:57.040
Madam told me to remind you

40:57.120 --> 40:58.880
to watch that woman's every move.

40:58.960 --> 41:02.800
If she does anything unusual,
report it to Madam first.

41:03.440 --> 41:04.600
What exactly is Madam planning?

41:04.680 --> 41:06.560
That's none of your concern.

41:06.640 --> 41:08.680
Madam will give you orders
when the time comes.

41:08.760 --> 41:11.040
If you slack off even a little,

41:11.120 --> 41:13.120
your whole family
will pay with their lives.

41:20.760 --> 41:21.600
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

41:21.680 --> 41:23.240
My Lady.

41:23.320 --> 41:26.400
My Lady, please save us!

41:26.480 --> 41:27.880
My Lady!

41:27.960 --> 41:29.720
Please save us!

41:30.480 --> 41:31.920
-Steward, go see what's happening.
-My Lady!

41:32.000 --> 41:33.800
-What's going on?
-So many people kneeling outside.

41:33.880 --> 41:35.400
What's so alarming?

41:35.480 --> 41:37.320
-Let's go see.
-Please save us!

41:37.400 --> 41:38.960
Please save us!

41:39.040 --> 41:42.000
-My Lady!
-Go tell His Lordship. Hurry.

41:42.080 --> 41:43.760
Please save us!

41:45.280 --> 41:47.000
Please save us!

41:47.080 --> 41:48.120
‎My Lady!

41:48.200 --> 41:49.480
What's going on?

41:49.560 --> 41:50.920
-They're here to see Lady Lu,
-Please save us!

41:51.000 --> 41:53.000
-No, to see Lady Wu'an.
-Please save us!

41:53.080 --> 41:54.680
-Me?
-Yes.

41:54.760 --> 41:56.560
Please save us!

41:56.640 --> 41:57.880
Please save us!

41:57.960 --> 41:59.200
My Lady!

41:59.280 --> 42:01.720
-Sir, please get up.
-My Lady, please save us!

42:01.800 --> 42:05.760
My Lady,
you kindly freed us from our contracts.

42:05.840 --> 42:07.520
Word has spread throughout the capital.

42:08.440 --> 42:11.760
At the foot of Mount Yaowang,
over 300 farming families,

42:11.840 --> 42:15.120
more than 2000 people,
have all benefited from your kindness.

42:15.760 --> 42:18.760
They all wish they could kneel here
and thank you.

42:18.840 --> 42:20.360
But none of them can write,

42:21.040 --> 42:23.320
so they put their handprints
on these bamboo slips.

42:24.000 --> 42:25.520
Every last one of them.

42:25.600 --> 42:27.360
They asked us to bring this to you.

42:28.240 --> 42:31.480
Please accept it,
and take us under your protection.

42:32.960 --> 42:34.880
Yes, My Lady. Please take it.

42:34.960 --> 42:36.480
Please take it, My Lady.

42:37.000 --> 42:38.480
Please take it.

42:38.560 --> 42:40.360
They've all come to seek
Noble Lady Wu'an's protection.

42:41.000 --> 42:42.760
Please, My Lady.

42:43.360 --> 42:46.160
Sir, I freed you
so you could live as free people.

42:46.760 --> 42:49.320
I don't need tenant farmers,
much less servants.

42:49.400 --> 42:50.560
Please, everyone, go home.

42:50.640 --> 42:52.880
-My Lady, please don't abandon us!
-Please don't abandon us!

42:52.960 --> 42:56.000
-Please don't abandon us!
-Please!

42:56.080 --> 42:58.440
-Please get up. I can't accept this.
-I won't get up.

42:58.520 --> 42:59.840
Please get up.

42:59.920 --> 43:01.600
You freed them from the cruel Han family

43:01.680 --> 43:03.080
and made them free people.

43:03.600 --> 43:04.920
That was indeed an act of kindness.

43:05.760 --> 43:08.160
But the capital's nobles
and powerful families

43:08.720 --> 43:10.480
see people and land as prizes to seize.

43:11.440 --> 43:12.760
Why would they let them go so easily?

43:12.840 --> 43:14.800
Once they lose their protector,

43:15.440 --> 43:17.520
they'll end up as something
everyone fights over,

43:18.040 --> 43:19.240
and face an even worse fate.

43:19.320 --> 43:21.840
‎Is there really no other way,
‎Your Ladyship?

43:21.920 --> 43:22.880
Don't forget,

43:23.880 --> 43:25.320
Whenever a countryman rises in power,

43:25.920 --> 43:27.240
families of modest means

43:27.320 --> 43:28.720
hand over their land and homes,

43:28.800 --> 43:30.520
gladly becoming tenants and servants.

43:30.600 --> 43:33.240
All they want is to be safe.

43:34.040 --> 43:37.200
They all come to you
because they chose you

43:40.920 --> 43:42.640
to be their true protector.

43:43.720 --> 43:46.720
My Lady, please… Please take us in!

43:46.800 --> 43:47.880
‎Please take us in!

43:47.960 --> 43:49.680
-Please take us in!
-Please!

43:49.760 --> 43:51.600
-My Lady!
-Please take us in!

43:51.680 --> 43:53.320
‎Take us in!

43:53.400 --> 43:56.600
-Take us in!
-Please!

43:56.680 --> 43:59.200
Please take us in, My Lady.

43:59.280 --> 44:00.480
‎Take us in, My Lady.

44:00.560 --> 44:03.320
-Please don't abandon us.
-Please take us in!

44:03.400 --> 44:04.360
‎Don't abandon us.

44:04.440 --> 44:05.560
I can't help you.

44:07.120 --> 44:08.520
Find someone else.

44:08.600 --> 44:13.160
-My Lady!
-My Lady!

44:13.240 --> 44:15.120
-Please!
-Please save us!

44:15.200 --> 44:17.080
-Please!
-Look.

44:18.200 --> 44:19.800
Still just a sheltered woman.

44:19.880 --> 44:23.800
Even if I gave them to you for free,
would you dare take them?

44:23.880 --> 44:26.200
My Lady!

44:26.280 --> 44:28.280
Please save us!

44:28.360 --> 44:29.800
My Lady!

44:29.880 --> 44:31.760
Please take us in!

44:31.840 --> 44:33.840
-Please save us!
-My Lady!

44:33.920 --> 44:38.880
-We have nowhere else to turn!
-Please save us!

44:43.000 --> 44:46.000
Please have mercy, My Lady!

44:46.080 --> 44:49.040
Please save us!

44:52.600 --> 44:55.120
Please take us in!

44:57.320 --> 45:00.040
All right. You have my word.

45:02.760 --> 45:05.800
My Lady will be our protector from now on!

45:05.880 --> 45:07.440
My Lady is our protector!

45:07.520 --> 45:08.520
Please, get up.

45:09.320 --> 45:10.640
Thank you, My Lady!

45:16.480 --> 45:17.320
Let's go!

45:19.360 --> 45:20.840
My Lady is truly kind!

45:20.920 --> 45:23.520
We have someone to protect us now!

45:38.720 --> 45:40.360
Why did you suddenly change your mind?

45:45.280 --> 45:46.480
I refused

45:47.160 --> 45:48.720
because I can barely protect myself.

45:49.600 --> 45:51.160
I couldn't protect them.

45:53.920 --> 45:55.440
But then I realized something.

45:56.680 --> 45:57.720
We make our own fate.

45:58.360 --> 45:59.600
"We make our own fate"?

46:00.640 --> 46:01.880
What do you mean?

46:01.960 --> 46:03.880
I've seen it myself in the Lu family.

46:04.880 --> 46:07.360
Every great noble house
has its own retainers.

46:08.160 --> 46:11.880
So a Noble Lady appointed by the Emperor
can certainly have them too.

46:13.480 --> 46:14.320
What are you planning?

46:16.200 --> 46:18.360
I'll train the young
and able into my own guards

46:18.440 --> 46:19.280
to protect me.

46:20.920 --> 46:23.880
As long as I live another day,
I can protect them for another day.

46:24.840 --> 46:27.600
Every region needs officials to govern it.

46:28.280 --> 46:31.040
Rather than let corrupt officials
hold power and make the people suffer,

46:31.920 --> 46:33.400
I would rather take that position myself.

46:34.320 --> 46:35.360
I know I can do

46:36.880 --> 46:38.800
better than any of them.

46:40.480 --> 46:42.080
No one ever taught you this,

46:43.280 --> 46:44.720
yet you figured it out on your own.

46:47.520 --> 46:48.760
You truly are clever.

47:13.280 --> 47:14.120
Watch your step.

47:30.280 --> 47:32.280
My Lord, My Lady,
the Empress Dowager summons you.

47:48.920 --> 47:51.200
Wei Rao. Do you know your crime?

47:52.080 --> 47:54.240
The Empress Dowager must have a reason
for summoning us privately.

47:54.880 --> 47:56.080
I fear Han Liao

47:57.000 --> 47:58.440
has already accused you
before Her Majesty.

47:59.480 --> 48:01.840
You mean the Empress Dowager
knows who I really am?

48:03.760 --> 48:05.280
Will you confess or not?

48:07.640 --> 48:10.720
I confess my guilt. I deserve death!

48:10.800 --> 48:12.040
Good.

48:13.480 --> 48:15.560
Confess your crime honestly,

48:16.560 --> 48:17.680
and name the mastermind.

48:18.680 --> 48:21.680
I may show mercy and spare your life.

50:41.480 --> 50:44.480
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
